<title>BELGIUM: SGB confirms sale of Accor stake.</title>
<headline>SGB confirms sale of Accor stake.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian holding company Societe Generale de Belgique SA (SGB) confirmed on Wednesday it was selling shares in French hotel group Accor for a capital gain of over two billion Belgian francs.</p>
</text>
